Under /api/v1:
Method	Endpoint	Purpose
GET	/repositories/{id}/commits	Paginated history anchored to a supplied SHA
POST	/investigations/{id}/commit-searches	Validate input and queue search
GET	/investigations/{id}/commit-searches	List searches
GET	/commit-searches/{id}	Progress and result
GET	/commit-searches/{id}/steps	Tested revisions and execution links
GET	/commit-searches/{id}/diff	Candidate versus parent diff
POST	/commit-searches/{id}/cancel	Cancel search and active execution
